    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for all renderable block types in the Whelmed document stack. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Blocks are NOT juce::Components. They are data objects that know how to measure their height and paint themselves into a <ref refid="classGraphics" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">Graphics</ref> context. <ref refid="classwhelmed_1_1_screen" kindref="compound">whelmed::Screen</ref> owns blocks and renders them in a single unified <ref refid="classwhelmed_1_1_block_1a49be1e117ab630072e6d6f7e96c85101" kindref="member">paint()</ref> call. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
